{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"mdeet-2021-chemistry-16","exam":"MDEET","year":2021,"subject":"chemistry","number":16,"points":3,"unitId":"electro","unitLabel":"산화·환원·전기화학","topic":"표준환원·환원전위·산화수","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["electro","stoich","organic_rxn","organic_properties"],"stem":"다음은 산성 수용액에서 철(Ⅱ) 이온(Fe2+)과 다이크로뮴산 \n이온(Cr2O7\n2−)의 반응과, 관련된 반쪽 반응 및 25℃에서의 표준 \n환원 전위(Eo)를 나타낸 것이다.\n(전체 반응)\n2−+aFe2++14H +⇄2Cr3++aFe3++7H2O\nCr2O7\n(a는 반응 계수이다.)\n(반쪽 반응) \nCr2O7\n2−+14H ++6e−⇄2Cr3++7H2O\nEo=1.33V\nFe3++e−⇄Fe2+\nEo=0.77V\n25℃에서 이에 대한 설명으로 옳은 것만을 <보기>에서 있는 대로 \n고른 것은? [3점]\n<보 기>\n2−에서 Cr의 산화수는 +7이다.\nㄱ. Cr2O7\nㄴ. a는 6이다.\nㄷ. 전체 반응의 평형 상수(K)는 10―\n(1.33−0.77)\n0.0592\n이다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018","t019","t020","t021","t022","t023","t024"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02","fig-03","fig-04","fig-05","fig-06","fig-07","fig-08","fig-09"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t025"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t026"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄱ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t027"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t028"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t029"]}],"answer":2,"acceptedAnswers":[2],"answerStatus":"source-text","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":29,"height":17,"region":0,"bbox":[228.3,5.261,11.6,6.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/mdeet-2021-chemistry-16/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":539,"height":37,"region":0,"bbox":[50.7,27.261,215.6,14.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t003"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/mdeet-2021-chemistry-16/02.webp"},{"id":"fig-03","width":34,"height":32,"region":0,"bbox":[61.1,51.261,13.6,12.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/mdeet-2021-chemistry-16/03.webp"},{"id":"fig-04","width":576,"height":38,"region":0,"bbox":